{"3993620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SCULPTURE", "steam_appid": 3993620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993620/extras/fb3ef5133b48631a9b8ab977d6b9da0b.poster.avif?t=1759417241\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993620/extras/fb3ef5133b48631a9b8ab977d6b9da0b.webm?t=1759417241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993620/extras/fb3ef5133b48631a9b8ab977d6b9da0b.mp4?t=1759417241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Andy decides to leave the hustle and bustle of the city and move to a peaceful environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few months later, holding back a slight sense of nostalgia, he arrives at this trailer park.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The busy days of being pushed and urged by someone no longer exist here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this place of rest, however, an unexpected incident occurs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro graphics with an emphasis on atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactions with strange residents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short horror experience of about 30 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump scares</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993620/extras/fb3ef5133b48631a9b8ab977d6b9da0b.poster.avif?t=1759417241\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"http